{"id":"heritage-006","category":"Artifacts","catKey":"artifacts","title":"Earthenware Legacy","title_rw":"Inzobe z'Amateka","title_fr":"Héritage en Terre Cuite","location":"Rubavu","era":"Pre-colonial","region":"West","desc":"Centuries of functional art, from milk jars to communal cooking vessels, reflecting the daily lives of ancestors.","desc_rw":"Ibihe byinshi by'ubuhanzi bwifashishwa, kuva imikono y'amata kugeza ibikoresho by'amazu.","desc_fr":"Des siècles d'art fonctionnel, des pots à lait aux ustensiles de cuisine communautaires.","image":"/assets/explore/artifact.jpg","tags":["pottery","artifacts","daily-life"],"featured":false,"createdAt":"2026-06-29T14:46:04.831Z","_id":"VJ6OKslCaScza2ZG"}
